        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-019-the-forms-of-tissues-or-cell-a-audit-v2-thompson1917-t1917-019-6>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-019-the-forms-of-tissues-or-cell-a-audit-v2-thompson1917-t1917-019-7>,
